#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Flutter platform-specific generated files
**/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
**/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.h
**/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake

# (선택) 모든 flutter 하위 자동 생성 파일 무시
**/flutter/generated_*

# Build outputs (in case of Windows/Linux build artifacts)
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/

# IDE / Editor build cache (optional)
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/

# macOS/iOS generated files
**/macos/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.swift
**/ios/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.m
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/